  "stages": "Early development UI precedes font-band and PDF text-block-isolation refinements. Final production UI and independent review use frozen core hashes. Production PPTX bytes match the earlier UI artifacts opened natively. Previous iteration reports are not rewritten.",
  "resolvedFindings": [
    "Removing direct highlight would reveal inherited color; explicit transparent override clears it",
    "Highlight bands used glyph ink bounds instead of independent whole-font line metrics",
    "Inherited object/group opacity double-composited highlight and glyph in PDF; bounded text-block Forms isolate the composite",
    "Covered merged cells accepted hidden values through sidebar setters",
    "PDF body replacement overlapping widgets returned success while leaving old field value/appearance",
    "PDF body replacement implicitly applied other pending redactions on the same page"
  ],
  "retainedFailureEvidence": [
    "text-highlight-review/initial-group-opacity contains the original alpha compositing failure",
    "Specialist initial warning oracle read model-level warnings without slide-level diagnostics; corrected without product change",
    "Calc initial independent ODS audit omitted repeated-column counts; original failed report retained"
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No arbitrary complex lossless compatibility or full reference-app feature parity",
    "Highlight font bands are added without rewriting existing baseline, vertical layout, clipping, exact-spacing or complex-script behavior",
    "SmartArt cached highlight rendering remains unsupported; source XML is retained with warning",
    "Imported highlight alpha is preserved, but the UI exposes explicit color and clear rather than alpha-only edits",
    "Reference glyph-alpha path drops highlight; this defect is documented rather than copied",
    "PDF isolation is bounded to text blocks and decorated runs, not a general rewrite of all object/group composites",
    "Calc dynamic-array/boolean/veryHidden engine differences remain; merged-cell preflight is not generic transaction rollback",
    "PDF text edits intersecting widgets, annotations or links, or any same-page pending redaction, are refused before mutation",
    "No new Windows/macOS package validation or publication"
  ],
